                                                "sense_id": "18b4a4d1-5758-3ed9-9434-9f6053c94f4c",
                                                "text": "the greedy Tuberon or Shark arm'd with a double row of venemous teeth pursues them, directed by a little Rhombus, Musculus or pilot-fish that scuds to and fro to bring intelligence [...]."
